      "title": "Cloud SQL active connections (server-side)",
      "description": "cloudsql.googleapis.com/database/postgresql/num_backends — the DB server's own view of connection count, useful cross-check against the app-side pgxpool gauges above (a mismatch usually means another client, e.g. the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy for local dev, is also connected).",
