    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Query Insights (console deep link)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 42 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Cloud SQL Query Insights (top queries, execution plans, lock waits) is a **console-only** surface — Cloud Monitoring exports aggregate CPU/memory/disk/connections but not per-query plan detail, so it cannot be a Grafana panel. Open it directly: https://console.cloud.google.com/sql/instances/goatos-stg-core-db/insights?project=goatos-stg. `insights_config` is enabled by `infra/envs/stg/cloud_sql.tf`."
      }
